    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm doing this paper for my intl relations class about economic sanctions and i'm kind of stuck on the main thesis. like, are sanctions actually even an effective way to promote democracy, or are they just a way for powerful countries to bully smaller ones? what do you think is the more accurate take?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
